Subject: [PATCH 1/8] docs(spec): propose holds and pinned coins for deferred,
 mutually exclusive offers

Adds a wallet-local hold model to the Wallet Specification: a Pinned coin
state between Final and Booked, a Detached transaction status, the
operations hold / detach_transaction / release_hold, an authorization on
spend, per-scope held balances, privacy rules for holds, and a
'Prepare a held offer (bid)' building stage. Lifecycle diagrams updated.
